    "title": "Home | Investment Opportunities Platform",
    "text": "An Official website of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia\nHow you know?\nYaseer\nInvestment Opportunities\nHome\nInvestment Opportunities\nAbout Us\nSearch\nعربي\nLogin\nExplore the best investment opportunities in Jazan City\nExplore Now\nExplore the best investment opportunities in Ras Al-khair City\nExplore Now\nExplore the best investment opportunities in Yanbu Industrial City\nExplore Now\nInteractive map\nExplore the best investment opportunities in Jubail Industrial City\nExplore Now\nExplore the best investment opportunities in Jazan City\nExplore Now\nExplore the best investment opportunities in Ras Al-khair City\nExplore Now\nExplore the best investment opportunities in Yanbu Industrial City\nExplore Now\nInteractive map\nExplore the best investment opportunities in Jubail Industrial City\nExplore Now\n3\nInvestment Opportunities\n2K\nInvestors\n4\nCities\n37\nSectors\nInvestment Opportunities\nView All\nDevelopment and Operation of Serviced Apartments i\nThe site enjoys a strategic location in Al Nakheel District, Yanbu Industrial City, south of Umm Al-Qura Street and west of King Fahd Road. It is conveniently located near various commercial and service facilities, restaurants, cafés, and banks. The site also offers easy access to major roads and is situated within an active residential and commercial area with available parking, making it well suited for the development and operation of serviced apartments catering to city visitors and business travelers.\n\nCommercial\nYanbu\nGet Started\nElectrical Transformers Manufacturing\nEstablish a manufacturing facility for Current Transformers (CT) and Voltage Transformers (VT) in Saudi Arabia. The project includes component manufacturing, assembly, testing, and quality control. It aims to localize a strategic electrical equipment industry, meet the growing demand from power and infrastructure sectors, reduce import dependency, and position the Kingdom as a regional hub for electrical equipment manufacturing and exports.\nIndustrial\nYanbu\nGet Started\nIndustrial & Infrastructure LED Lighting Fixtures\nA modern manufacturing facility for high-quality Industrial & Infrastructure LED Lighting Fixtures for industrial, commercial, and infrastructure applications. Target sectors include manufacturing, logistics, oil & gas, utilities, transportation, public infrastructure, and large-scale development projects. The increasing adoption of energy-efficient lighting systems and continuous infrastructure expansion create strong demand for locally manufactured lighting solutions\nIndustrial\nYanbu\nGet Started\nIndustrial Cities\nJubail\nLearn more\nYanbu\nLearn more\nJazan\nLearn more\nRas Al-Khair\nLearn more\nComplaints & Suggestions\nFor any inquiries or comments about our services , please fill in the required information.\nContact Us\nCookies\nThis site uses cookies to ensure ease of access and to provide a better user experience while browsing. By continuing to browse, you acknowledge your acceptance of this site's Terms and Conditions and its use of cookies.\nPrivacy Policy\nAccept\nReject\nRelated Sites\nThe Ministry of Industry\nECZA\nIndustrial Development Fund\nMinistry of Investment\nSaudi Invest\nGoverment Services\nYaseer E-services\nCareers portal\nContact\nContact Us\nComplaints and Suggestions\nE Participation\nCommunity Engagement Policy\nService Level Agreement (SLA)\nAccessibility Policy\nCustomer Charter\nSecurity Policy\nFAQ\nUser Manual\nFollow us\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions \nSitemap\nCopyright © for Royal Commission for Jubail & Yanbu \nYaseer\nInvestment Opportunities",
