    "text": " Official government website of the Government of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia\nHow to verify\nAbout the Platform\nE-Services\nLicenses\nWorkforce Development\nTourism Investment\nKnowledge Center\nData & Insights\ntourismX\nالعربية\nLogin\nHome\nE-Services\nRegister interest on investment opportunity\nRegister interest on investment opportunity\nAccess The Service\nThis service enables the beneficiary to register interest in available tourism investment opportunities.\nSteps\nStep 1\nMain Page\nStep 2\nE-services\nStep 3\nTourism Investment\nStep 4\nRegister interest in an investment opportunity\nService Beneficiary\nPrivate Sector\nExecution Duration\nInstant\nService Fees\nFree\nService Channels\nTourism.sa\nService Availability\n24/7\nFrequently Asked Questions\nTourism.sa FAQ\nPhone\n930\nEmail\ninfo@mt.gov.sa\nMobile Application\nComments & suggestions\n\nFor any inquiry or feedback on Government Services, please fill the required information.\n\nContact us\nOverview\nAbout Ministry of Tourism\nNational Tourism Strategy\nToursim Laws and Regulations\nNews and Events\nUser Guide\nCareers\nMinistry of Tourism Services\nHelp Center\nE-services\nTourism Data Request\nViolations and Objections Management\nDiscover Investment Opportunities\nTraining and Development Programs\nSubmit Tourism Investment Idea\nSubmit Land for Investment\nImportant Links\nVisit Saudi\nSaudi Tourism Authority\nTourism Development Fund\nSaudi Vision 2030\nThe National Unified Platform\nThe National Open Data Platform\nE-Participation\nReporting Corruption Case (Nazaha)\nBeneficiaries Engagement Center (Amer)\nSocial Media\nAccessibility Tools\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nService Level Agreements (SLA)\nFAQs\nComplaints Guide\nCookies Policy\nSitemap\nAll Rights Reserved For Ministry Of Tourism © 2026",
