  "tourism-investing": {
    "status": 200,
    "url": "https://tourism.sa/en/tourism-investing",
    "title": "Tourism.sa - Tourism Investment",
    "text": " Official government website of the Government of the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia\nHow to verify\nAbout the Platform\nE-Services\nLicenses\nWorkforce Development\nTourism Investment\nKnowledge Center\nData & Insights\ntourismX\nالعربية\nLogin\nHome\nTourism Investment\nTourism Investment\nInvesting in Saudi Arabia\nInvestment Opportunities\nInvestment Enablers\nInvestor Hub\nInvesting in Saudi Arabia\n\nUnder the theme Prosper in Saudi Tourism, the Ministry of Tourism designs and implements multiple investor attraction, support, and enablement programs.\n\n50+\nTourism Opportunities\n18\nMajor Destinations\nSTATISTICS\nInvestment Facts\nand Figures\nExplore All\n303.7B\n\nTotal Domestic and Inbound Tourism Spending in 2025\n\nSAR 449\n\nHotel ADR in 2025\n\n29.3M\n\nInbound Tourists in 2025\n\n597K+\n\nKeys in 2025\n\nInteractive Guide\nFor Investors\n\nA 7-step pathway from concept to licensed operation, connecting you with key opportunities, support programs, and essential government entities.\n\nView Details\nCHOOSE YOUR INVESTMENT PATH\nInvestment Opportunities\nOpportunities\n\nExplore curated investment opportunities across various sectors and regions.\n\nExplore Opportunities\nSubmit an Idea\n\nHave an innovative idea? Share it with our ecosystem and turn it into impactful investment opportunities.\n\nSubmit Idea\nInvest Your Land\n\nDo you own land with development potential? List your land for investors and unlock new opportunities.\n\nSubmit Your Land\nFinancing & Enablement\nOpportunities\n\nExplore a range of enablers designed to help investors bring their tourism projects to life. From financing solutions to capacity building programs, these opportunities are tailored to support businesses of all sizes across the Kingdom's tourism sector.\n\nFinancing Opportunities\nHuman Capital Support\nTourism Development Fund\n\nThe Fund offers several innovative financing solutions and support for small, medium, and large tourism establishments.\n\nTamkeen Programs\n\nThe Tourism Empowerment Programs support and empower establishments in the tourism sector by creating a wide range of financing options that cater to the needs of micro, small, and medium enterprises.\n\nTourism Partners Program\n\nA Riyad Bank & Tourism Development Fund program that supports private tourism projects by offering finance solutions and supporting the development of tourism projects.\n\nKafalah Program\n\nKafalah is a government financing guarantee program aimed at enabling small and medium enterprises to obtain the funding needed to develop and expand their businesses, by providing guarantees to financiers to cover part of the financing risks.\n\nINTERACTIVE MAP\nStart Your Investment\nJourney in Saudi Arabia\n\nDiscover investment opportunities across the Kingdom’s most promising tourism destinations.\n\nGo to Interactive Map\nOverview\nAbout Ministry of Tourism\nNational Tourism Strategy\nToursim Laws and Regulations\nNews and Events\nUser Guide\nCareers\nMinistry of Tourism Services\nHelp Center\nE-services\nTourism Data Request\nViolations and Objections Management\nDiscover Investment Opportunities\nTraining and Development Programs\nSubmit Tourism Investment Idea\nSubmit Land for Investment\nImportant Links\nVisit Saudi\nSaudi Tourism Authority\nTourism Development Fund\nSaudi Vision 2030\nThe National Unified Platform\nThe National Open Data Platform\nE-Participation\nReporting Corruption Case (Nazaha)\nBeneficiaries Engagement Center (Amer)\nSocial Media\nAccessibility Tools\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nService Level Agreements (SLA)\nFAQs\nComplaints Guide\nCookies Policy\nSitemap\nAll Rights Reserved For Ministry Of Tourism © 2026",
